  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural context and user preference mapping for development of a Shiraka alumni network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conduct a qualitative research on cultural aspects and preferences among STP/TMT alumni and Dutch embassies, in order to identify what is needed to successfully build a dynamic and supportive alumni community. By creating an alumni community we contribute to the creation of a professional network facilitating the exchange of best practices and collaboration, thereby strengthening the capacity of (semi-) governmental institutions to design and implement effective governance reforms and strengthening the international network of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in the Netherlands with government officials in the MENA region.</narrative>
  </description>
